# 统一换行符：仓库内文本文件一律 LF，检出到 Windows 也不自动转 CRLF，
# 避免每次提交都出现 `warning: LF will be replaced by CRLF`，也避免整文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 构建脚本保持 LF（在 Linux CI 与 macOS 上执行）
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做换行转换，也不要在 diff 里尝试按文本合并
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.zip binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
*.ipa binary

# 语言统计：文档与生成物不计入
*.md linguist-documentation
docs/** linguist-documentation
